      "rule": "adherence-logging-and-attestation",
      "reason": "This attestation grades a plan, not work. Every FIRED status above attests to the quality of a preparation whose predictions are untested by construction; the priors could be systematically wrong and nothing here would show it. An attestation over an unexecuted batch is weaker evidence than its verdict field can express, and the verdict is DEVIATION-LOGGED partly for that reason."
